    "title": "Man killed after being struck by a vehicle on I-240 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Micah Thompson/KFOR No media credit provided. ,\n2 hours ago\nOKLAHOMA CITY ( KFOR ) — Authorities confirm one person has died after an autoped in Oklahoma City.\nThis is located at I-240 near Penn.\nOklahoma Highway Patrol says the man was trying to cross the interstate when he was struck and killed.\nThe driver stayed at the scene and was cooperating with troopers.\nThis is a developing story.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KFOR.com Oklahoma City.\n3",
